OL,3,GNEWSALewes adopts charter recognising
OL,4,Arights of trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town in East Sussex has become the
OL,7,Ffirst in England to recognise the
OL,8,Frights of all trees through an adopted
OL,9,Fcharter.
OL,11,FLast week, Lewes Town Council (LTC)
OL,12,Funanimously approved a motion granting
OL,13,Fseveral rights to trees, including the
OL,14,Fright to life, to flourish, to be
OL,15,Frestored and to complete natural life
OL,16,Fcycles.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,329,320,200,140,0,100
