OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSALewes adopts charter recognising
OL,4,Arights of trees
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe motion, created by a number of
OL,7,Fgroups working together since May, was
OL,8,Fguided by a toolkit developed by Dr
OL,9,FJoanna Miller Smallwood, who leads the
OL,10,FEnvironmental Justice Law Clinic at the
OL,11,FUniversity of Sussex.
OL,13,FShe said: "We wanted to create a
OL,14,Fresource that all councils and
OL,15,Fcommunities can use. It strikes a chord
OL,16,F- people really care about trees."
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
